          <li><a href="/eviction-notice/michigan/demand-for-possession/" class="text-brand-cta hover:underline font-semibold">Michigan Demand for Possession</a> — Understanding DC 100a and other Michigan court forms.</li>
          <li><a href="/3-day-notice/" class="text-brand-cta hover:underline font-semibold">3-Day Notice (Other States)</a> — How Michigan's 7-day notice compares to 3-day states.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

